  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given that the elevation to the top of the tower from the feet of one person due south is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p>Similarly the angle of elevation to the top of tower from the feet of another person to the west of tower is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p>The given information can be represented in the form of a diagram as below:</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d9027470-8cac-438d-85f2-27af5d056f35.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 212px;\" /></p><p>We need to find the distance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math>.</p><p>Let the distance of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;from the tower be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi></math></p><p>Hence this is the correct option.</p>",
    "image": null
